 "notes": "All SKUs are ble+iot. Mode constants: GEAR=1, CUSTOM=2, AUTO=3; H7150/H7151/H7152/H7153 add DRY_CLOTHES=4. H7141/H7142 use a family-local constant table but identical values. H7149/H7152/H7153 are UI/pact glue and inherit base_h71xx controllers. Read responses are stripped by 2 bytes (0xAA class) or 3 bytes (write echo). Chart data is TH-sensor data, not humidifier telemetry. Exact 0xAA fault-code enumerations, H7141 clear-72h ACK path, and H7161 parse start offsets are not fully recoverable from the decompiled sources (see md gaps).",
 "status_properties": [
